# Git worktrees
#
# Home for `git worktree add worktrees/<name>` checkouts. Ignored so worktrees
# can live inside the clone (the only path bind-mounted into the dev container)
# without ever showing up as untracked content. See worktrees/README.md.
/worktrees/*
!/worktrees/README.md

# Claude Code's built-in worktree feature puts its checkouts here instead of
# ./worktrees/. Ignored so a stray one never shows up as untracked content;
# worktrees/README.md has the intended location.
.claude/worktrees/
